:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Li'l Island Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Li'l Fish Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] grants increased health, attack power and recharge time and a chance to perform [[Critical Hit]]s. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

